exports[`render > table node — obsidian links 1`] = `
"---
table: orders
domain: commerce
refs_out: [users]
refs_in: [order_items]
---
# orders
> Order header. One row per checkout.

## Columns
| column | type | constraints | meaning |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | bigint | PK, null |  |
| user_id | bigint | not null |  |
| status | order_status | null, default pending |  |
| channel | varchar(20) | not null | Sales channel the order came through. |
| total | numeric | not null | gross amount · Formula: \`SUM(order_items.qty * order_items.price)\` |

## Enums
\`order_status\`: pending = awaiting payment confirmation · shipped = handed to courier · cancelled = user or system cancelled
\`channel\`
- \`WEB\` — Online storefront
- \`POS\` — In-store point of sale
- \`PARTNER\` — Third-party partner integration

## Relationships
- → [[users]] via user_id (many-to-one)
- ← [[order_items]] via order_id (many-to-one)

## Indexes
- idx_user_status on (user_id, status)

## Rules
- Never delete; cancel via status
"
`;
